Firefox adapter	Says MV2/MV3 background.js	Define exact browser-specific manifest and background behavior
Local-first	Claims complete offline functionality	Define web app offline installation and storage lifecycle
Safari	Combines Safari and web companion	Separate extension from ordinary web app
